# S14: Platform Hygiene + CI

## Objective

Fix accumulated technical debt: commit S08–S11 (60+ uncommitted files), clean
typecheck errors, add GitHub Actions CI (lint + typecheck + test), fix MCP wiring
so PM can use `explain()` during any session, and audit secrets hygiene.

## Prerequisites

- S13 CLOSED
- All tests green before committing

## Known debt targeted

1. **S08–S11 uncommitted** — 60+ modified + ~20 untracked files in `app-agent-io/core`
2. **MCP not wired** — `.mcp.json` scope mismatch (project root vs user root)
3. **TypeCheck errors** — 12+ from S04 era (demo-saas + control)
4. **Totem not in git** — sprint intel at risk of loss
5. **feature:health** not in CI — broken SEE refs go undetected

## Tasks

- [ ] S14-T01-FreezeInvariants.pd
- [ ] S14-T02-CommitS08S11.pd
- [ ] S14-T03-TypecheckClean.pd
