## Definition of Done

- [ ] `git log --oneline` shows S08–S11 as clean commits on `test-app`
- [ ] `bun run typecheck` exits 0 (or documented exceptions with issue numbers)
- [ ] GitHub Actions runs on push: lint + typecheck + vitest + feature:health
- [ ] `explain()` tool available during PM execution from any session root
- [ ] Totem `sprints/` dir is in a git repo (or documented backup strategy)

